      "subject": "feat(executive): suspend and resume the Chief Agent, and the dashboard health and platform card read Runtime (MS-2026-0004)",
      "body": "Suspend and resume work from the command deck with a reason; the request carries confirm, because Runtime previews every activation decision otherwise, and anything but a recorded decision shows as not recorded with Runtime's reasons. Resume requires every activation prerequisite valid, which ADR-0045 made true again. The platform health tile shows the activation certifications, refreshed every 5 minutes since they are re-derived on read; Runtime and knowledge health read learning, canonical knowledge and canonical reviews. A new read-only route gives the platform card the repository, branch, latest commit and each workspace's stack; deployments say none recorded. Recommendations stay a marked design preview until their source is decided. Presentation of the command deck, dashboard and projects certified after owner visual approval. Runtime suites pass.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0004\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
